WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the Rem0te walkthrough. The video is caption-led and has no
narration or audio track; these cues mirror the on-screen captions so the
walkthrough is searchable and accessible. Timings match media/walkthrough.mp4.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Rem0te — self-hosted remote support for customer
businesses, powered by RustDesk.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Signing in to a demo environment. Every business,
person and device shown is fictitious.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.500
The dashboard: every customer business, computer
and session in one overview.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.500
Client locations are plotted from each device's
last known address.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Workflow 1 — find a customer, then their computers.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Each business owns its own computers, people
and history.

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.500
Platform, live status and last-seen for every
enrolled machine.

8
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.500
Light and dark themes both ship with the product.

9
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.500
Workflow 2 — enrol a managed device.

10
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.500
The business is fixed into the installer. The
machine that runs it cannot choose another.

11
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.500
Choose exactly who may connect once it is enrolled.

12
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.500
Workflow 3 — three levels: Platform Admin,
Business Owner, Business User.

13
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.500
Owners hold everything; each business user shows
the capabilities actually granted.

14
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.500
Quick Connect — one-off help for a machine that
is not enrolled.

15
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:32.500
No install and no managed computer is created.
It ends when they close the client.

16
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:40.500
Live sessions and full history, per business.

17
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:47.500
Every action is written to an append-only audit log.

18
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:54.500
Service health, CPU, memory and disk on the host.

19
00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:01.500
Self-hosted. Open source. No RustDesk Pro required.

20
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:08.000
github.com/agit8or1/rem0te — more free tools for
MSPs at mspreboot.com
